          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Deductions} &= 650.25 + 314.80 + 120.50\\\\ &= \\$1\\,085.55\\\\\\text{Gross income minus deductions} &= 87\\,210 - 1\\,085.55\\\\ &= \\$86\\,124.45\\end{align*}$$\nTaxable income is \\$86 124, rounded down to the nearest whole dollar.",
