        "answer": {
          "short": "Refund of \\$5 976.22",
          "worked": "There are 26 fortnightly instalments in a year.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total instalments} &= 26\\times1\\,006\\\\ &= \\$26\\,156\\\\\\text{Refund} &= 26\\,156 - 20\\,179.78\\\\ &= \\$5\\,976.22\\end{align*}$$\nHer instalments exceed her total tax payable, so she is entitled to a refund.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
